      "source_quote": "111.1 66% (vol/vol) 二氯甲烷(DCM)/33% 甲醇混合液浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 3 hours)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0041",
      "parent_id": "N0040"
    },
    {
      "label": "111.2",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 2999,
      "end": 3056,
      "label_start": 2999,
      "label_end": 3004,
      "body_start": 3005,
      "body": "100% DCM 浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 2 × 1.5 hours)\n",
      "source_quote": "111.2 100% DCM 浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 2 × 1.5 hours)\n",
      "node_id": "N0042",
      "parent_id": "N0040"
    },
    {
      "label": "112",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3057,
      "end": 3101,
      "label_start": 3057,
      "label_end": 3060,
      "body_start": 3061,
      "body": "RI 匹配（Refractive index matching, DBE）  \n",
      "source_quote": "112 RI 匹配（Refractive index matching, DBE）  \n",
      "node_id": "N0043",
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "label": "112.1",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3101,
      "end": 3186,
      "label_start": 3101,
      "label_end": 3106,
      "body_start": 3107,
      "body": "100% 二苄醚（DBE, RI≈1.56）预浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 3 hours, Light: protected)  \n",
      "source_quote": "112.1 100% 二苄醚（DBE, RI≈1.56）预浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 3 hours, Light: protected)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0044",
      "parent_id": "N0043"
    },
    {
      "label": "112.2",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3186,
      "end": 3277,
      "label_start": 3186,
      "label_end": 3191,
      "body_start": 3192,
      "body": "新鲜 100% DBE 继续浸泡至完全透明（全脑通常需要）。(Temperature: RT, Time: 12–24 hours, Light: protected)\n",
      "source_quote": "112.2 新鲜 100% DBE 继续浸泡至完全透明（全脑通常需要）。(Temperature: RT, Time: 12–24 hours, Light: protected)\n",
      "node_id": "N0045",
      "parent_id": "N0043"
    },
    {
      "label": "113",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3278,
      "end": 3316,
      "label_start": 3278,
      "label_end": 3281,
      "body_start": 3282,
      "body": "保存与成像前处理（Storage & pre-imaging）  \n",
      "source_quote": "113 保存与成像前处理（Storage & pre-imaging）  \n",
      "node_id": "N0046",
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "label": "113.1",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3316,
      "end": 3410,
      "label_start": 3316,
      "label_end": 3321,
      "body_start": 3322,
      "body": "样本全程浸没于新鲜 100% DBE，避光密封保存（尽量充满容器减少氧化）。(Temperature: RT or 4 ℃, Time: up to 1–2 weeks)  \n",
      "source_quote": "113.1 样本全程浸没于新鲜 100% DBE，避光密封保存（尽量充满容器减少氧化）。(Temperature: RT or 4 ℃, Time: up to 1–2 weeks)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0047",
      "parent_id": "N0046"
    },
    {
      "label": "113.2",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3410,
      "end": 3479,
      "label_start": 3410,
      "label_end": 3415,
      "body_start": 3416,
      "body": "光片成像前更换一次新鲜 DBE 并静置脱气泡/沉降。(Temperature: RT, Time: 1–2 hours)  \n",
      "source_quote": "113.2 光片成像前更换一次新鲜 DBE 并静置脱气泡/沉降。(Temperature: RT, Time: 1–2 hours)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0048",
      "parent_id": "N0046"
    },
    {
      "label": "113.3",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3479,
      "end": 3584,
      "label_start": 3479,
      "label_end": 3484,
      "body_start": 3485,
      "body": "成像介质与物镜匹配：使用 RI≈1.56 的DBE兼容成像腔与密封材料；样本固定于支架后直接进行全脑光片扫描。(Temperature: RT, Time: per imaging session)",
      "source_quote": "113.3 成像介质与物镜匹配：使用 RI≈1.56 的DBE兼容成像腔与密封材料；样本固定于支架后直接进行全脑光片扫描。(Temperature: RT, Time: per imaging session)",
      "node_id": "N0049",
